Solutions to all three questions of the <University of Oxford> <numerical linear algebra> paper, sat on 2 June 2025. Source: https://www.whatdotheyknow.com/request/past_papers_omms/response/3521346/attach/3/FOI%20202607%20785%20Exam%20Papers%20OMMS.pdf#page=1[released examination PDF, parent PDF pages 1–3]. The question statements are omitted. The Gaussian-matrix estimates in parts 2(b)(v) and 3(b)(iv) are used as the paper explicitly permits; their limitations are explained in those solutions.

= 1
{parent=2025}
